      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coffee_City%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Coffee City includes Ledbetter Bay and its two inlets to the south and extends beyond Caney Bay to the north.",
